      "mergeID": "5be91682f5266966f4ef45be",
      "mergedPostDetails": "It would be cool if they had a separate tag/icon for streamers when they're on air. \n\nThere should also be a another option for regular users where they can opt to be muted and invisible to anyone with a streamer tag.\nI usually block loud and obnoxious streamers but with the new trust system, blocking might reduce their trust score. This can be a better alternative. Besides, a lot of us prefer to not end up as content for someone else.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Add a Streamer tag or icon for streamers. + option to be invisible to streamers.",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5b5d4e7917cd0a7367f27f72",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, no. Streamers already get enough of what they want. Always all about the streamers, seriously. We do not need another thing >just for streamers< the ranks were only for streamers, no one else. You can go ahead and disagree with me all you want but because the devs only asked streamers for opinions, we got ranks, and cause of that streamers are now discriminating hard against lower ranks and even non streamers are doing that too.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
