      "mergeID": "5be91682f5266966f4ef45be",
      "mergedPostDetails": "It would be cool if they had a separate tag/icon for streamers when they're on air. \n\nThere should also be a another option for regular users where they can opt to be muted and invisible to anyone with a streamer tag.\nI usually block loud and obnoxious streamers but with the new trust system, blocking might reduce their trust score. This can be a better alternative. Besides, a lot of us prefer to not end up as content for someone else.",
