      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5adf87eeee6da475b8353316|full_name}: \n\nI see this feature as more pro-regular user than pro streamers. Currently we have no way of knowing if someone in the instance is a streamer or not unless they explicitly say so, behave like one or have a custom on air tag.\n\nI just think everyone has a right to know that they are being recorded. Also, everyone ought to have a right to be opted out of said recording.",
